            "title": "Access Meeting Booths"
          }
        },
        "template--16816299114721__04e915ad-dc54-4882-8c19-69a67c786f0b-text-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<h3><strong>Enhance Focus and Productivity with Our Access Meeting Booths</strong></h3><p>Soundbox Store is your trusted provider of advanced sound solutions and access acoustic meeting booths. We are committed to creating inclusive workspaces that support both productivity and comfort for all.</p><p>Our Access Meeting Booths are designed to provide a soundproof, private environment perfect for meetings, conference calls, and focused work. With wheelchair access and high-quality acoustic dampening, these booths ensure a quiet, distraction-free space where accessibility and productivity go hand-in-hand.</p><h3><strong>What Sets Our Access Meeting Booths Apart?</strong></h3><p>At Soundbox Store, we know that an inclusive, peaceful environment is key to fostering collaboration and concentration. Our booths are specially designed to accommodate wheelchair users while delivering the same high level of soundproofing and comfort as our standard meeting pods.</p><h3><strong>Quality and Service You Can Trust</strong></h3><p>We prioritise quality in every product we offer. Each accessible booth is crafted with the best recyclable materials to ensure long-lasting performance. Our team is always on hand to help you find the perfect solution for your workspace's unique needs.</p><h3><strong>Why Choose Our Access Meeting Booths?</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Wheelchair-Friendly Design</strong><br/>Every booth is carefully designed to be fully accessible, making it easy for everyone to use comfortably.<br/></li><li><strong>Power and Connectivity</strong><br/>Equipped with power points, USB and USB-C ports, and Ethernet (CAT 6) to support your devices.<br/></li><li><strong>Customisable Interiors</strong><br/>Tailor the booth's design to fit your office style and enhance functionality.<br/></li><li><strong>Boost Productivity</strong><br/>Foster collaboration and focus in an environment where accessibility and performance come first.</li></ul><p><strong><br/></strong>Discover how our Access Meeting Booths can transform your office space and elevate your team’s productivity.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
